</span></span>gent<span id="S4.T3.10.1.6.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> <span id="S4.T3.10.1.6.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.0pt;"><img src="2602.23320v1/figures/llama.png" id="S4.T3.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:13/13;" width="13" height="13" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span></span></span></th>
